  "scope": "Single-tick hit-mask settlement handles simultaneous shared-risk nonlinearity. Across ticks only mean HP/risk are retained; survival and conservative pressure recovery are approximate. Death ends a native match before 800ms; resources stop at that terminal event, and effective health is zero for dead units. HP/risk are diagnostic-only private reads; the public provider returns effective health only. This run overlaps the larger benchmark and makes no performance claim.",
